rpretation_note":"《隋書》帝紀所傳父子，忠稱皇考繫高祖文皇帝。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null},{"id":"a-nanshi024-wangmeng-jian","subject_person_id":"ce8_yhf_283_AAAAAA","object_person_id":"ce8_yhf_283_AAAAA","predicate":"father","qualifiers":{"source_term":"忠即皇考也","nanshi024_wangmeng_reading":"jian","lineage":"paternal"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-suishu","book_id":"b-suishu-001","source_id":"s-suishu-001-yangjian-family-context-ws8230488","chapter_id":"c-suishu-001-yangjian-family-context","paragraph_id":"c-suishu-001-yangjian-family-context:p001","quote":"高祖文皇帝姓楊氏，諱堅，弘農郡華陰人也。漢太尉震八代孫鉉，仕燕為北平太守。鉉生元壽，後魏代為武川鎮司馬，子孫因家焉。元壽生太原太守惠嘏，嘏生平原太守烈，烈生寧遠將軍禎，禎生忠，忠即皇考也。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-suishu-001-yangjian-family-context:p001:m0010","object_person_mention_id":"c-suishu-001-yangjian-family-context:p001:m0088","relationship_anchor":{"paragraph_id":"c-suishu-001-yangjian-family-context:p001","surface":"忠即皇考也","start":88,"end":93}}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"《隋書》帝紀所傳父子，忠稱皇考繫高祖文皇帝。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"title_holdings":[{"id":"th-liangshu-029-xiaolun-complete-9-169","title":"大將軍","kind":"office","mode":"attestation","person_id":"ce8_yhf_283_AAAAA","attestations":[{"id":"th-liangshu-029-xiaolun-complete-9-169:a","paragraph_id":"c-liangshu-029-xiaolun-complete:p009","start":169,"end":172,"surface":"大將軍","person_mention_id":"c-liangshu-029-xiaolun-complete:p009:m0172","usage":"narrative","date_expression":null}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-liangshu","book_id":"b-liangshu-029","chapter_id":"c-liangshu-029-xiaolun-complete","source_id":"s-liangshu-029-xiaolun-complete-ws1538079","paragraph_id":"c-liangshu-029-xiaolun-complete:p009","quote":"時綸長史韋質、司馬薑律先在于外，聞綸敗，馳往迎之。於是復收散卒，屯于齊昌郡，將引魏軍共攻南陽。侯景將任約聞之，使鐵騎二百襲綸，綸無備，又敗走定州。定州刺史田龍祖迎綸，綸以龍祖荊鎮所任，懼爲所執，復歸齊昌。行至汝南，西魏所署汝南城主李素者，綸之故吏，聞綸敗，開城納之。綸乃脩浚城池，收集士卒，將攻竟陵。西魏安州刺史馬岫聞之，報于西魏，西魏遣大將軍楊忠、儀同侯幾通率衆赴焉。二年二月，忠等至于汝南，綸嬰城自守。會天寒大雪，忠等攻不能克，死者甚衆。後李素中流矢卒，城乃陷。忠等執綸，綸不爲屈，遂害之。投于江岸，經日顏色不變，鳥獸莫敢近焉。時年三十三。百姓憐之，爲立祠廟，後世祖追諡曰攜。","person_mention_id":"c-liangshu-029-xiaolun-complete:p009:m0172"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"所見原官稱，未載全任期。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null,"human_reviewed":false}],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-liangshu-029-xiaolun-complete:p009","text":"時綸長史韋質、司馬薑律先在于外，聞綸敗，馳往迎之。於是復收散卒，屯于齊昌郡，將引魏軍共攻南陽。侯景將任約聞之，使鐵騎二百襲綸，綸無備，又敗走定州。定州刺史田龍祖迎綸，綸以龍祖荊鎮所任，懼爲所執，復歸齊昌。行至汝南，西魏所署汝南城主李素者，綸之故吏，聞綸敗，開城納之。綸乃脩浚城池，收集士卒，將攻竟陵。西魏安州刺史馬岫聞之，報于西魏，西魏遣大將軍楊忠、儀同侯幾通率衆赴焉。二年二月，忠等至于汝南，綸嬰城自守。會天寒大雪，忠等攻不能克，死者甚衆。後李素中流矢卒，城乃陷。忠等執綸，綸不爲屈，遂害之。投于江岸，經日顏色不變，鳥獸莫敢近焉。時年三十三。百姓憐之，爲立祠廟，後世祖追諡曰攜。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":55,"last_line":55,"raw_start":4656,"raw_end":4946,"raw_character_offsets":[4656,4657,4658,4659,4660,4661,4662,4663,4664,4665,4666,4667,4668,4669,4670,4671,4672,4673,4674,4675,4676,4677,4678,4679,4680,4681,4682,4683,4684,4685,4686,4687,4688,4689,4690,4691,4692,4693,4694,4695,4696,4697,4698,4699,4700,4701,4702,4703,4704,4705,4706,4707,4708,4709,4710,4711,4712,4713,4714,4715,4716,4717,4718,4719,4720,4721,4722,4723,4724,4725,4726,4727,4728,4729,4730,4731,4732,4733,4734,4735,4736,4737,4738,4739,4740,4741,4742,4743,4744,4745,4746,4747,4748,4749,4750,4751,4752,4753,4754,4755,4756,4757,4758,4759,4760,4761,4762,4763,4764,4765,4766,4767,4768,4769,4770,4771,4772,4773,4774,4775,4776,4777,4778,4779,4780,4781,4782,4783,4784,4785,4786,4787,4788,4789,4790,4791,4792,4793,4794,4795,4796,4797,4798,4799,4800,4801,4802,4803,4804,4805,4806,4807,4808,4809,4810,4811,4812,4813,4814,4815,4816,4817,4818,4819,4820,4821,4822,4823,4824,4825,4826,4827,4828,4829,4830,4831,4832,4833,4834,4835,4836,4837,4838,